@* Example Flow *@

@* You request /Home/StartView. *@

@* MVC looks at Views/_ViewStart.cshtml → sees Layout = "_Layout";. *@

@* MVC applies _Layout.cshtml around your StartView.cshtml. *@

@* MVC injects the content of StartView.cshtml into @RenderBody() *@


